msgid "Borrow, completion and observer lifetime"
msgstr "借用、完成与观察者生命周期"

msgid ""
"The caller owns request and buffer storage. Accepted asynchronous I/O "
"borrows it; rejection does not. Cancellation, a deadline or a failed stop "
"cannot revoke that borrow. This separation prevents IRQ/DMA or an executor "
"from accessing recycled memory. The [lifecycle contract](../design/next-"
"generation-platform.md) and public operation declarations define exact "
"context and result behavior."
msgstr ""
"调用方拥有请求与缓冲区存储。已接受异步 I/O 借用存储；拒绝不借用。取消、截止时间或失败停止都不能撤销借用。这防止 IRQ/DMA "
"或执行者访问已复用内存。[生命周期合同](../design/next-generation-"
"platform.md)和公共操作声明定义精确上下文与结果行为。"

msgid "Event"
msgstr "事件"

msgid "Storage consequence"
msgstr "存储责任"

msgid "Rejected admission"
msgstr "拒绝准入"

msgid "No retained request/buffer references or residual hardware effects"
msgstr "不保留请求/缓冲区引用或残留硬件效果"

msgid "Accepted admission"
msgstr "接受准入"

msgid "Keep request and buffers valid until acquire-observed SETTLED"
msgstr "保持请求和缓冲区有效，直到 acquire 观察 SETTLED"

msgid "Cancel or deadline"
msgstr "Cancel 或截止时间"

msgid "Request termination; continue required progress and retain borrow"
msgstr "请求终止；继续必要进度并保留借用"

msgid "DMA completion"
msgstr "DMA 完成"

msgid "Memory engine stage complete; wire/publisher references may remain"
msgstr "内存引擎阶段完成；wire/发布者引用可能仍存在"

msgid "Failed drain / QUARANTINED"
msgstr "失败排空 / QUARANTINED"

msgid "Keep storage and explicit recovery responsibility"
msgstr "保留存储与明确恢复责任"

msgid "SETTLED publication"
msgstr "SETTLED 发布"

msgid "Provider's final access has ended after necessary reference drain"
msgstr "必要引用排空后，提供者最终访问已结束"

msgid "Observer/control reuse"
msgstr "观察者/控制复用"

msgid "Also detach/drain matching epochs and join observers"
msgstr "还需 detach/drain 匹配 epoch，并 join 观察者"

msgid ""
"![Current borrowed request state and settlement proof "
"obligations](../assets/diagrams/request-lifecycle.svg)"
msgstr "![当前借用请求状态与最终结束证明义务](../assets/diagrams/request-lifecycle.svg)"

msgid "Current borrowed request state and settlement proof obligations"
msgstr "当前借用请求状态与最终结束证明义务"

msgid ""
"FIG-06 does not treat REJECTED/ACCEPTED as request-state enum members. Core "
"helpers cannot observe a peripheral's physical drain; the provider must "
"establish that proof before publishing settlement."
msgstr ""
"FIG-06 不把 REJECTED/ACCEPTED 当成请求状态枚举。Core 辅助函数不能观察外设物理排空；提供者必须先建立证明，才能发布结束。"

msgid "Three different completion facts"
msgstr "三种不同的完成事实"

msgid ""
"![Current UART and SPI memory, wire and final-publication "
"order](../assets/diagrams/dma-completion.svg)"
msgstr "![当前 UART/SPI 内存、线上与最终发布顺序](../assets/diagrams/dma-completion.svg)"

msgid "Current UART and SPI memory, wire and final-publication order"
msgstr "当前 UART/SPI 内存、线上与最终发布顺序"

msgid ""
"FIG-07 separates memory completion, wire completion and final publication. "
"UART TC is not NDTR zero; SPI idle and CS interval are not a DMA interrupt. "
"Disable and detach the actual IRQ/DMA/queue references before release-"
"publication of SETTLED. The caller's acquire observation then exposes the "
"final result/count. A timeout result can be final only after this lifecycle,"
" not at deadline expiry."
msgstr ""
"FIG-07 分开内存完成、线上完成与最终发布。UART TC 不是 NDTR 为零；SPI 空闲和 CS 区间不是 DMA 中断。Release 发布"
" SETTLED 前，必须关闭并解除实际 IRQ/DMA/队列引用。调用方 acquire 观察后才能取得最终 "
"result/count。超时结果只有经过这一生命周期才能最终成立，不能在截止时间到达时直接认定。"

msgid "Cross-task control and continuous streams"
msgstr "跨任务控制与连续流"

msgid ""
"Use stable slots plus monotonically increasing epochs for remote control. Do"
" not send a raw pointer to storage another task can recycle. Detach "
"control/observer references and join observers before releasing the slot and"
" preparing the next request. A generation counter detects stale identity but"
" does not itself join a task."
msgstr ""
"远程控制使用稳定槽和单调递增 epoch。不得传递另一任务能够复用存储的裸指针。释放槽并准备下一请求前，必须解除控制/观察者引用并 join "
"观察者。代次计数可检测过期身份，但自身不会 join 任务。"

msgid ""
"Continuous receive and ADC use explicit caller-owned block loans. A consumer"
" keeps a block immutable until matching release. The producer needs a "
"replacement target before publishing an old hardware bank. No replacement "
"means visible stop/backpressure; it must never overwrite a consumer. Stop "
"waits for filling, ready and borrowed blocks, not just active DMA. [The "
"stream contract](../design/io-observation-recovery.md) records what loss "
"counters and software timestamps do and do not prove."
msgstr ""
"连续接收与 ADC 使用调用者显式拥有的块借用。消费者必须保持块不可变，直到匹配释放成功。生产者发布旧硬件 bank "
"前，必须取得替换目标；无法替换时显式停止或施加背压，绝不能覆盖消费者。停止需等待正在填充、就绪及已借用的块，而不只是活动 "
"DMA。[流合同](../design/io-observation-recovery.md)说明丢失计数与软件时间戳能够证明及不能证明的范围。"

msgid ""
"![Current continuous block producer, replacement and loan "
"drain](../assets/diagrams/continuous-stream.svg)"
msgstr "![当前连续块生产者、替换与借用块排空](../assets/diagrams/continuous-stream.svg)"

msgid "Current continuous block producer, replacement and loan drain"
msgstr "当前连续块生产者、替换与借用块排空"

msgid ""
"FIG-15 includes observable loss and stop/drain responsibilities. Capacity "
"and service-latency budgets are explicit product inputs; arbitrary IRQ delay"
" or consumer speed cannot be promised lossless. The "
"[tutorial](../tutorials/async-io.md) executes rejection and quarantine; [OS "
"shutdown](../guides/os-shutdown.md) explains wait and join responsibilities."
msgstr ""
"FIG-15 包括可见丢失和停止/drain 责任。容量与服务延迟预算是明确的产品输入；不能承诺任意 IRQ "
"延迟或消费者速度下无损。[教程](../tutorials/async-io.md)执行拒绝和隔离；[OS 停机](../guides/os-"
"shutdown.md)说明等待与 join 责任。"
